5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must look beyond the numbers to the human element.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I wonder if the grant money actually buys the same things now?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should check what happened to past awards.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,Why do we always hear about delays only after the money is gone?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,The infrastructure supporting these projects is often the silent bottleneck.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, looking back is wise, but we must also see who remains.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi, delays are scary! I want to know if the money shrinks too.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Servas, yes, but I worry our instincts about 'promise' have failed us before.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Minako, infrastructure? I think the interruptions are more about people and time.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Takumi, interruptions often stem from shared resources being overbooked or failing.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,The hands that do the work are the true currency here.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I’m going to peek at the ledgers to see where the coins went!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at the finished awards to see what actually stuck.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I need to see the incident logs. Something is breaking the flow.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will check the facility day rates and the incident logs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,Let us see who is truly standing in the field.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I’ll also check the closeout files to see the final tally.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"And the portfolio review of schedule overruns, to see the pattern.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I’ll also look at the staffing rolls for technical posts.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,I will also look at the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
