35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The hands are gone, but the minds are scattered.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"@Minako, the ledgers say the bench fees are still covered! That’s good news!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Servas, I found that the 'promising' ones often stalled, but the plain ones kept working.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Minako, the logs show the machines are broken because there’s no one to fix them.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,"@Takumi, yes, the spectroscopy suite was idle for eleven weeks due to a lapsed contract.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, that is a hard truth. We must value the steady hands.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, so the plain ones are the real winners? I like that!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, yes, the ones that just kept going were the ones that delivered.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, the staffing rolls show the technicians left, but the coders are coming.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, the computing agreement covers simulation hours, but the animal units cost more now.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"We have the code, but we lack the care.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I’m glad the bench fees are safe! I can focus on the science now.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m still worried, but seeing the data helps me feel less alone in this.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,We can’t just buy code. We need people who know how to use the tools.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,"The spare capacity in shared services is the real risk, not the grant amount.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us choose the path that respects the time it takes to grow.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I’m ready to vote! I want to support the one that keeps the lights on.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I think we should trust the track record over the hype.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,I agree. We need to protect the time for the actual work.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minako,,I will vote for the candidate who accounts for the shared infrastructure load.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
